# Two stabs of 85+4x%, so 178% a target at level 1 and 330% at max. GMS runs
# 90+5x over 15 levels; stretching it to 20 keeps the same 165% a stab at the
# top, which is the rule every skill here follows. It ends level with Lucky
# Seven, which is why the dagger it demands matters: the two are the same 330%
# over the same 5 targets, and only the weapon tells them apart.
name: "Double Stab"
skill_order: 1
description: "In and out before the blood follows. Quickly stab a nearby enemy."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ROGUE
max_level: 20
base_delay_ms: 690
lines: 2
max_enemies: 5
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_DAGGER
base {
  skill_pct: 0.89
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.04
}
